window.products.push({"id":483206,"name":"Ram Pro Nylon Turner Kitchen Cooking Utensil Made of Heat Resistant Nylon Ideal for Easy Food Preparation or Serving (Blue) Pack Of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818kZxdOclL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ram Pro Blue Nylon Turner The Problem: You have a turner with you in your kitchen, but it scrapes the pan or pot where you intend to fry the food. This is exactly the reason as to why the turner is not a suitable one for use. The turner which you have is not of the sufficient length so you feel the heat at the time of frying the foods in your kitchen. Our Solution: The turner nylon comes with an appropriate design which is just perfect for being used with the non stick pans or pots as it will not scrape the coating at the time of frying food in them. Our nylon turner is of the ideal length which makes the distance between your hand and what you are cooking longer thereby making sure that you do not feel the heat at the time of frying the foods in your kitchen. Resists High Temperatures The nylon turner set can easily resist temperatures up to 450 degree Fahrenheit. Most importantly, the nylon turner comes with a very suitable working handle thereby making it easy to hold as well as grip at the time of using in the kitchen. Ideal Design The long design of the nylon turner makes the distance between your hand and what you are cooking longer which necessarily makes sure that the hands do not feel the heat at the time of cooking. Storing and Cleaning is Easy There is a hole in the handle of the potato masher hence storing becomes much easier since it can be hanged with ease. The design of the nylon turner heat resistant is as such that it becomes very easy to clean. In an addition to this, the nylon turner is dishwasher safe and therefore cleaning is also not at all difficult. Readily Used in the Kitchens The nylon turner heat resistant is just ideal for the purpose of turning, tossing, flipping, twisting and holding of food items at the time of frying which makes it one of the most functional products in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818kZxdOclL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RamPro","source_asin":"B07YSYPFLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YSYPFLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YSYPFLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
