window.products.push({"id":483212,"name":"Chawan or Matcha Tea Bowl, Ceramic Bowls, Pottery Handmade in Vermont (Mixed Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oZz6qxidL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There is a lot of variation with tea bowls or Chawans. There are some with a rustic look, some made with the idea of wabi-sabi (roughly meaning embracing imperfection or flawed beauty), some made with a foot, others shallow. This particular type of Chawan is designed to easily whisk Matcha tea with a rounded bottom and taller sides. The size is designed to large enough to whisk tea while being small enough to easily drink directly out of without feeling awkward. Chawans can also be considered and used as rice bowls. The bowl itself is handcrafted in Vermont on a pottery wheel using glaze and clay that is lead-free. The bowl is also dishwasher safe. When preparing the Matcha it’s best to mix the powder with 2 oz. of water and whisk then slowly stir in more water to taste. The bowl holds 8 oz. when full although 4-6 oz. of tea is a good average but it depends on desired strength of flavor. It's best to use water that has cooled slightly from a boil. If you use boiling water directly it can make the tea bitter Lunch Rejuvenation is dedicated to finding and making quality products to help you arrive back from lunch inspired not dog tired. We appreciate all comments and reviews","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oZz6qxidL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lunch Rejuvenation","source_asin":"B016MWUU40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016MWUU40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016MWUU40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
