window.products.push({"id":483216,"name":"Helga Adhesive Hooks- Large Designer Wood Base and Metal Wall Hooks for Home and Office. Waterproof, Rustproof Bathroom hooks for Towels. Damage-Free ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UVLbUC6iL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"【High-Quality Towel and Home Hook】The towel hooks are made of high-quality steel with different metal finished, which are waterproof and rustproof. The multi-layer brushed finish of wall hooks can resist scratches, corrosion and tarnish. Smooth surface without sharp edges, bathroom, kitchen or closet hook can safely hang bathrobes, towels, purses, or clothes. 【Heavy Duty】The towel hooks innovative strong self-adhesive backing, which has strong adhesion and high load-bearing capabilities, ensuring quality and service for life. The modern design of the adhesive hooks will not damage the wall, keeping your home clean and pristine. 【Size of Adhesive Hooks】The size of wall hook is 9cm(L) x 9cm(H) x 1.2 cm(D). It can hold a total weight of 4.4 (lbs) pounds. Modern style, New Zealand Pine brushed gold finish hook create a simple and elegant appearance, suitable for most bathrooms or hotel decoration. 【Easy to Install】 No need to drill, no tools needed! Just follow the easy instructions on the back of the packaging or watch our tutorial how-toll video. Before using the towel hooks, please keep the wall surface clean, dry and smooth. It is best to wait for 24 hours to ensure better adhesion of the wall hooks. 【Wide Application】You can stick the towel hooks on smooth hard surfaces, such as tiles, refrigerator doors, wardrobes, marble, wood tiles, ceramics, mirrors, stainless steel, acrylic, plastics, laminates, etc. It is not recommended to use the hooks on textured lime wall, concrete wall, painted wall, dry wall and wallpaper. Rough surfaces will reduce the stickiness or damage your wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UVLbUC6iL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09LB6G1HB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LB6G1HB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LB6G1HB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
