window.products.push({"id":483246,"name":"Design Toscano The Three Egyptian Canopic Jars of The Pharaoh s Tomb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OgdE0o-8L._AC_.jpg","description":"These scaled Canopic jars hearken from the ancient Egyptian belief that creating vessels like these helped families connect with their loved ones in the afterlife. Our set of three Canopic jars are fashioned after the sons of Horus with a falcon head, human head, and jackal head. Sculpted with details from ornate headdresses to etched hieroglyphic designs, our Egyptian collectibles are cast in quality designer resin and hand painted in faux ebony and gold exclusively for Design Toscano. Each can hold about a shot glass-size amount of treasure and makes a great gift for the Egyptophile! Each: 2½ \"dia. x7½ \"H. 1 lb.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OgdE0o-8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Design Toscano","source_asin":"B06XZZ29QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZZ29QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZZ29QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
