window.products.push({"id":483374,"name":"Simple&Opulence French Linen Duvet Cover Set - Queen Size(88\" x 92\")- 3 Pieces (1 Comforter Cover,2 Pillowcases)- Natural Flax Cotton Blend-Solid Colo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+SkP8d5jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Queen Size Package Includes】 3 Pieces Washed Linen Cotton Blended Duvet Cover Set:1 Duvet Cover (88\" x 92\"),2 Standard Pillowcases(20\"x 26\"). Note: Duvet insert and pillows are not included. 【Fabric Feature】Made of 55% Linen and 45% Cotton Fabric. Our Luxury linen blended duvet cover set retains rich texture of Linen, with soft touch and washed style. It has better moisture absorption and breathability than cotton fabric, which can ensure that you feel cool in summer and warm in winter. It is suitable for all seasons, making your sleeping environment very comfortable. Gets softer with every wash. Not easy to shrink and fade.OEKO-Tex certified material. 【Design and Gift Choice】The neutral duvet cover set adopts solid color design, which brings elegant and classic appearance to your bedroom. 5 colors for you to choose from. It will match fabulously with any interior decor, suitable for master bedroom and guest room. Our linen bedding sets arrive tied up in a bundle with a cotton ribbon, like a little gift package. It is also the perfect gift for Birthday / Mother's Day / Christmas / Wedding / Housewarming /Thanksgiving Day. 【Product Details】Duvet Cove:4 inner corner ties to secure the duvet and minimize shifting; Hidden Button closure on the bottom side of duvet cover，has a small flap that holds the buttons from falling out after washing. Pillow Sham: no zipper, with a middle flap, which can cover the pillow well and it is very convenient to put in or take out the pillow. 【Use Instructions】Wash under 60℃;Warm Iron; Tumble dry with medium heat; Wash with similar colors. Find suitable Comforter or Bedspread for hot sleeper, please search the Comforter ASIN B08SR3NX5J, and the Bedspread ASIN B097SRHYJM.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+SkP8d5jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simple&Opulence","source_asin":"B09K4VYVSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K4VYVSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K4VYVSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
