window.products.push({"id":483378,"name":"Water Tree XIV by Moises Levy, 22 by 32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8161IGK4ObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gallery-wrapped art piece features a tree in water. Born in Mexico City, Moises Levy is a lifelong resident there, and works in the city as an established architect. He has a deep appreciation of the natural relation between light and architecture, and it was this interest in the qualities of light that lead Levy to photography. As a counterpoint to his work as an architect he has now been drawn to landscape work. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8161IGK4ObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00GSPPG3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSPPG3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSPPG3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
