window.products.push({"id":483473,"name":"THOMAS LEE Percale Sheet Set - Crisp, Cool, Luxurious - 500 Thread Count, US-Grown Pima Cotton - Classic White, Cali King Sheets & Pillowcases","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":296.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vetq72USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Imported 100% US-GROWN PIMA LONG STAPLE PURE COTTON - Crisp and cool to the touch. The Thomas Lee sheets become even softer every time you wash them. All Thomas Lee products are backed by our 30 night warranty. If you are not satisfied for any reason, you can return them for a full refund. We are dedicated to ensuring you have an incredible night’s sleep! ORDER NOW, risk-free. PERCALE 500 THREAD COUNT - We love cotton percale for its smooth, crisp hand. Offered in white or ivory—our Classic Percale collection can be mixed, matched and layered however you please. An excellent everyday luxury, it’s perfect for every bed in your home. HIGHEST QUALITY BEST COTTON SHEETS - If you love the feel of luxurious hotel sheets and crisp cotton sheets, you’ll adore our single-ply 500 thread count sheets. We use fine yarns made with long staple Pima cotton, the longest, strongest and finest fibers available coupled with the percale weave making our sheets softer, stronger and more durable. Our sheets are sewn by highly skilled craftsman, with an amazing 12 stitches per inch. CALI KING LUXURY - 4-Piece Bed Sheets Set - Each set includes 1 Flat Sheet, 113” x 114”; 1 Fitted Sheet, 72” x 84” + 18”, with deep pockets to fit mattresses from 9\" to 18\"; and 2 King Pillowcases, 20” x 42”. NATURAL & PURE - Every percale sheet is always natural and pure. We never treat our sheets with any harsh resins or chemicals. Our supply chain is free of any harmful pesticides as well making them ideal of customers with sensitive skin or allergies. Each Thomas Lee sheet is made with accountability for the human and environmental resources that make it possible. All of our bedding products are ethically sourced.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vetq72USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THOMAS LEE","source_asin":"B01JVGK3LY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JVGK3LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JVGK3LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
