window.products.push({"id":483625,"name":"Square Canvas Wall Art: Contemporary Coastal Beach, Neutral Nature, Modern Fractial Floral, Multi Color Flower Abstract Wall Art for Home & Office - D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m-7SBYFEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY ART: Our in-house production and design team are constantly checking the quality and detail of the artwork we provide to ensure an exceptionally produced product for your home and style. This canvas print features a frameless, gallery wrap, production method where the canvas is stretched around the sides of a solid wood frame. Purchase these prints in multiples and place them in different rooms to bring a cohesive theme to your home decorating. HAND MADE IN USA: This design printed on premium canvas, professionally hand-made and ready to hang. We take pride in our printmaking process for creating high-quality fine art reproductions. This product is UV resistant, fade resistant & water resistant. Additionally, the canvas is stretched around the sides of a solid wood frame. Purchase these prints in multiples and place them in different rooms to bring a cohesive theme to your home decorating. RANGE OF SIZES AND THEMES: We have an ever-growing catalog of artwork for you to choose from and offer a variety of sizes to fit your exact space. From large to small and options in between. We offer a nice selection of sizes. Whether you are looking for a new piece to greet you at your entryway, something to proudly display in your office, or some new art to adorn your bedroom wall, we have just the print for you. A PERFECT GIFT: Treat yourself or someone you care for. Artwork is a great gift idea for holidays, birthdays, anniversaries, graduations, or just because. Give a gift that will be a warm reminder of you. Art can be placed anywhere no matter the size of the home, apartment, dorm, or office and can be displayed in just as many places, from a kitchen, to a bathroom, living room, hallway, and more. Decorate a wall with something worth looking at. GREAT SERVICE: Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m-7SBYFEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Renditions Gallery","source_asin":"B08GJ8877D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GJ8877D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GJ8877D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":483626,"name":"Sleepwish Unicorn Curtains for Living Room Bedroom Girl's Bedroom Black Pink Kids Unicorn Flower Window Drapes (2 Panels, 52x84 Inch, Grommet Top)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SSoj-R76L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Having a hard time choosing the right curtains for your home? Ask any decorator and they’ll tell you the same thing: Curtains make a room. When chosen correctly, your window treatments can have a strong and positive impact on your space. That being said, shopping for the right curtains can be an overwhelming process. There are too many factors to consider. You’ll have to take into account the fabric, color, length, lining and processing. How do you choose which ones are right for your home? Sleepwish 3D Printed Curtain provides the perfect fabric and designs to match your home interiors. We offer curtains in many different designs. Whether you’d like to provide a more magical space for your child or create your own private sanctuary, we’ve got just the right drapery for you. And because our options include prints for both boys and girls, these curtains are great for dormitories, too! These drapes are not your ordinary window, wall or doorway covers. We feature 3D printing, which brings the decorations to life. It will completely change your space, taking you wherever you’d like to be. How about creating a world where unicorns are real? You’ll love the velvet hemp material we use. It’s known for being one of the strongest and most eco-friendly fabrics, and yet, it also gets softer with time. Here are more reasons to love our artful tapestry: ✅ The thick and insulating fabric is breathable ✅ Tough against abrasion and will stay new for a longer period ✅ Velvet hemp is less amorphous, so it’s better at staying in shape Sleepwish 3D Printed Curtain has just the right fabric and designs you’re looking for. Add it to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SSoj-R76L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepwish","source_asin":"B088ND84DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088ND84DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088ND84DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
