window.products.push({"id":483741,"name":"Axolotl Kids Bedding Cartoon Cat Comforter Set Twin Size,Gradient Line Cute Cat Bedding Set for Teens Kids Boys Girls Adults Room Decor,Kids Comforter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-XjM-yqNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cat Bedding】Cute Cat Pattern Bedding Set for Boy Kids.Bright and vivid patterns bring joy to boys and attract them to bed early. 【High Quality】100% Polyester fabric which is soft,comfortable, breathable and durable,making an additional bedtime fun and cloud-like feeling.Appropriate for all seasons. 【Great Gift】The duvet & pillowcases can be used as birthday gifts, Easter gifts, Halloween gifts,Christmas gifts,beautiful and practical.Fun,eye-catching print that appeals to cat lover.Cute and bright.Definitely pops in darker rooms with led lighting. 【Easy to Care】Easy care. This colorful duvet set is machine wash mild in cold water and tumble dry on low. Do not bleach.Do not soak. Since the quilt is vacuum bagged,there may be some wrinkles when you receive it. You can put it in the dryer on low heat to help smooth out wrinkles and it will come out fluffy. 【3 PIECES】 1X Comforter + 2X Pillow cases. ☞ PLEASE NOTE: No Sheet, No fitted sheet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-XjM-yqNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Axolotl","source_asin":"B0BQBS3FV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQBS3FV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQBS3FV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":483742,"name":"Manual Woodworkers & Weavers Paws and Whiskers Throw Pillow, Little Lord Malty Maltese, 18\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ou7QR8XrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the mountains of North Carolina, manual WW weaves, sews, prints, and develops not just the fabrics, textiles, and beautiful products you'd expect from a Heritage company, they bring you the freshest designs for your home. Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the Mountain areas of Bat cave in Western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville postcard company. When the depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the Wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ou7QR8XrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MWW","source_asin":"B01IDHX8S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IDHX8S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IDHX8S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
