window.products.push({"id":483898,"name":"26 Pcs Breakable Heart Silicone Molds Set for Chocolate with 20 Wooden Hammers, Letter and Number Molds, 2 Droppers, 2 Diamond Heart Shaped Molds for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+qHY8zmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT IDEA FOR GIFTS AND SURPRISES: There is no better idea than a gift hidden in the heart of chocolate if you like romance and surprise. Our molds set gives you the best gift solution. The soft mold that even beginners can use easily allows you to make chocolate without any difficulties. 20 strong and durable wooden hammers are included in the set. More hammers for your prearranged heart-chocolate gift and chocolate-themed party reserve. EASY TO DEMOULD AND CLEAN: The smooth, non-stick surface makes it very easy to pop out the chocolate, not prone to crack or residue, maintain the perfect 3D diamond heart shape when you demould. It’s dishwasher safe, very easy to clean up. DURABLE SILICONE AND NATURAL WOOD: The mold is made of premium food-grade silicone, no coating, no BPA, healthy and sturdy, with good flexibility and softness. Totally safe to use between -40℉ to 446℉ in the freezer, oven or the microwave. Cute wooden hammers are made of natural wood with no painting or lacquer, good for kids and the elderly. VERY VERSATILE IN DAILY LIFE: This set is a perfect combination for making breakable chocolate hearts and decorations as a surprise or gift box. Number and letter molds can be made to spell any name and date or age you want, practical and fun. You can also make dome mousse, jelly, ice cream, popsicle, fondant and other dessert by it. Cute hammers are not just for smashing hearts but also a learning and entertainment gadget for children. THE BEST IDEA FOR CELEBRATIONS: Adding more happiness and fun by hiding gifts under breakable hearts, it can make the perfect surprising gifts or hand-made decorations for the parties and festivals like birthday, Valentine’s day, Halloween and Christmas. Also the unique but romantic idea for the celebrations like weddings, anniversaries and proposal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+qHY8zmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIWARE","source_asin":"B08YN286P8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YN286P8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YN286P8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
