window.products.push({"id":483949,"name":"DII Ultra Soft Plush Spa Cotton Pebble Absorbent Chenille Bath Mat Place in Front of Shower, Vanity, Bath Tub, Sink, and Toilet, 17 x 24 - Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUUISoV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience Optimum Comfort with DII Popcorn Bath Rug DII offers Chenille popcorn bath mats in two sizes and varies colors. Sizes include 17x24” and 21x34”. The 17x24” size is great for pairing two bath mats together: one in front of the bath tub and one in front of a single sink. Or you could also pair two mats in front of a double sink for a unique look. The 21x34” size will fit in front of your double sink, a larger Jacuzzi tub, a shower or a full length bath tub. The plush, soft cotton provides comfort for your feet when you hop out of the shower, while you get ready, and while you wash your hands. Spa-like experience in your Bathroom Bring the feeling of the spa into your bathroom as you sink your feet into this plush bath rug. This bath rug is ideal for in front of your sink, shower, bath tub, toilet, and vanity in your bathroom. Perfect for a guest or master bathroom in your home. Perfect bath mat for every household or a great gift for housewarming, wedding shower or any special occasions. Quality you can rely on DII Popcorn Bath Rugs are made with high quality 100% Cotton with tight knit which stands up to repeated daily use. The plush cotton is soft on your feet and is designed to quickly absorb water, keeping your bathroom floors dry and clean. The strong construction allows the water held in the mat to dry quickly, leaving the mat smelling and feeling clean, dry. The Sturdy design will keep the mat looking the same even after you just got out of the shower. With the selection of colors available you can be confident that they will match your existing or new bath decor. Easy Washing and Care Instructions • Machine Washable, Color Separately • Wash in Cold Water in Gentle Cycle • Lay Flat to dry • Do not use Bleach So Many Great Options To view our entire selection of options search: DII Bath Mat or visit our brand page at amazon.com/dii for a full range of products. Our Bath Mat/Rug Products Include: • Vinyl Bathtub Mat • Pebble Vinyl Bathtub Mat • 100% Cotton Woven Ribbed Bath Mat • 100% Cotton Chenille Microfiber Bath Rug • 100% Cotton Jacquard Bath Rug • 100% Cotton Popcorn Bath Mat • Polyester Popcorn Bath Mat • 100% Cotton Woven Bath Rug","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUUISoV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B00MXTU5AQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-483949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MXTU5AQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MXTU5AQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
